@page "/"

<h3>Day 7 Demonstration -- Cart Checkout Guard</h3>

<div class="alert alert-info">
    <p>
        This is the instructor demonstration project for Day 7. It shows a single
        route guard: the <strong>checkout page redirects to the shop when the cart
        is empty</strong>.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-0">
        Add items on the <a href="/shop">Shop</a> page, then visit
        <a href="/checkout">Checkout</a>. Try visiting Checkout directly with an
        empty cart -- the guard sends you back to Shop before the page renders.
    </p>
</div>
